<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX index closes PSE session down 5.8 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX index closes PSE session down 5.8 pts.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Reuters RPIX index closes Monday's Prague Stock Exchange session down 5.8 points, or 0.57 percent, at 1,010.7.</p>
<p>*Turnover 11.6 million crowns.</p>
<p>*Komercni Banka, up early in the session, closes down 37 crowns at 1,680.</p>
<p>*Chemopetrol, SPT Telecom also lose ground, CEZ unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
